      "divergence": {
        "accepted": true,
        "normalized": {
          "sessionId": "sess-1",
          "prompt": [
            {
              "type": "resource_link",
              "name": "n",
              "uri": "file:///a"
            }
          ]
        },
        "because": "The schema types this property `{\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"],\"format\":\"int64\"}`, so 1.5 is not a value it admits — and the property carries x-deserialize-default-on-error, so refusing it recovers to absent rather than failing the message. The reference implementation validates int64 and int32 properties as `z.number()`, reaching for `z.int()` only where the schema also states a minimum, so it keeps the fraction. AGENTS.md says the schema wins."
      }
